{
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 proof of Written on the Wall II Conjecture 372 of Graffiti.pc on its defined domain: every finite tree T on more than two vertices with path cover number p(T) ≥ 2 satisfies γ_t(T) ≥ τ(T) / (p(T) − 1), where γ_t is the total domination number and τ the vertex cover number. Two variants are also proved: τ(T) ≤ γ_t(T) for trees of order at least two that are covered by at most two disjoint paths, and τ(T) ≤ γ_t(T) · max(1, p(T) − 1) for every tree of order at least two. The statements are those of the Formal Conjectures repository.",
